/*
 * Declares the MemoryValue class.
 * Aggregates all module importations of memory-related generator values.
 *
 * MemoryValue is the abstract ancestor of all memory-manipulation operations
 * (addressing, referencing, dereferencing, copying, aliasing, moving, lazy
 * evaluation, futures, etc.). All concrete memory operations extend this class
 * to ensure consistent handling of lvalue semantics, throwers, and reduction
 * state.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::memory
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/memory.yr
